ORIGIN AND THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
-------------------------------

This is an independent recreation of the 1970s Thomas Organ Cry-Baby
(model 95-910511, board 25-5500-2) in KiCad. The schematic and PCB layout
in this repository are original work and are covered by the licence above.

The original circuit dates from the 1970s and its patents have long since
expired. However, the following are NOT covered by this licence and are
not redistributed here:

  - The "Layout by Andrew F. Shorty" home-etching artwork sheet and the
    associated schematic transcription, which were used as dimensional
    references only.
  - Photographs of original hardware posted by third parties to
    forum.pedalpcb.com.
  - The PedalPCB "Tear Jerker Wah" build documentation, consulted as a
    reference for the universal inductor land pattern.

